        {
          "text": "Duuba AABBO Waaqi d'ukuba biyyati buuse, wonti akanatiifi worrati Haruni korma worqi irreeni mid'aasise.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EXO.32.35",
